ritical), sees complex connections, spatial vision, leadership. Show-off and not open to new ideas are concerns but perhaps less safety-critical than hot temper or egocentric. However, not open to new ideas could affect adaptability.\n\nWe need to argue with evidence. Let's propose recommendation for Candidate A, but note concerns. Provide reasoning.\n\nWe must include metadata vote.\n\nProceed."}
